<title>SPAIN: Spain's Telefonica Q1 revenues by division.</title>
<headline>Spain's Telefonica Q1 revenues by division.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telefonica de Espana group gave the following breakdown of its first quarter revenues by business division (in billion of pesetas, unless stated).</p>
<p>							Q1 97     Q1 96</p>
<p>    Basic telephony			    368.31    326.47</p>
<p>    International calls			 34.22     33.33</p>
<p>    Public phone booths			 17.99     19.47</p>
<p>    Data transmission			   12.67     11.87</p>
<p>    Mobile telephony			    82.82     49.06</p>
<p>    International business		   108.46     73.92</p>
<p>    Advertising				    1.91	0.86</p>
<p>    Multimedia				     0.71	0.71</p>
<p>    Others					 (74.83)   (58.70)</p>
<p>    TOTAL GROUP REVENUES		     552.25    456.98</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
